illion dollars in revenue.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":11},{"id":"cmpqjzttr0016qo0kqfvseqiq","message":"Understood. How did you approach the design process for that platform?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":12},{"id":"cmpqjzttr0017qo0klt0oef53","message":"Tell me about the ideal design process that should be used.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":13},{"id":"cmpqjzttr0018qo0koqkk66k9","message":"I’d like to hear your perspective first. What steps did you take in that project, from initial concept to final design?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":14},{"id":"cmpqjzttr0019qo0kvy6thq6u","message":"No, I don''t remember. Please tell me your view.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":15},{"id":"cmpqjzttr001aqo0ka9z1w6yo","message":"I’m here to focus on your approach, not to provide my own views. Let’s keep it centered on your experience. Even if it’s high level, can you share one or two steps you followed in that UI design process?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":16},{"id":"cmpqjzttr001bqo0kxtpmamyn","message":"I had gathered requirements from the clients, and based on the requirements, I developed a few wireframes on Figma, made a working prototype based on that, which we call as MVP, and then moved ahead.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":17},{"id":"cmpqjzttr001cqo0kyk6hm591","message":"Thank you. What tools or libraries did you use to implement those UI designs in production?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":18},{"id":"cmpqjzttr001dqo0k8jcippj9","message":"I use Figma. However, can you tell me more what are the other tools that can be used?","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":19},{"id":"cmpqjzttr001eqo0kmdcn2oxv","message":"Figma is great. Other tools include Sketch, Adobe XD, and InVision. Now, how do you handle design handoff to developers?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":20},{"id":"cmpqjzttr001fqo0kuebviueh","message":"Oh, I have no idea about it.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":21},{"id":"cmpqjzttr001gqo0kh42o85lb","message":"I understand. Just share what you’ve done so far. Even if you’ve only provided design specs or assets, that’s fine. Can you describe any past collaboration with developers on a project?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":22},{"id":"cmpqjzttr001hqo0ko5nqfvvm","message":"Please help me with the answer.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":23},{"id":"cmpqjzttr001iqo0knjwswmab","message":"I have passed on designs excellently.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":24},{"id":"cmpqjzttr001jqo0kxmeyvryp","message":"Got it. Now let’s talk about your experience with React. How comfortable are you with using React in your projects?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":25},{"id":"cmpqjzttr001kqo0ke9ylvin2","message":"What is React?","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqj