":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":42},{"id":"cmpqjzttr0021qo0kxdezd2r5","message":"Understood. Let’s wrap up with one last question. What’s one area of UI design or React that you’re hoping to improve on next?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":43},{"id":"cmpqjzttr0022qo0kdw5dhk86","message":"Give me some examples where I can do some improvements.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":44},{"id":"cmpqjzttr0023qo0k4yx7uh7r","message":"Sure. You could deepen your skills in responsive design, design systems, or state management in React. That can help you grow. Thank you for your time today. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:41:13.407Z","sessionId":"cmpqjrn6l000sqo0kb9u6k69j","orderIndex":45}],"domain":"product designer","keySkills":["UI Design","React"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"product designer","mandatoryQuestions":["tell me your self"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-05-29 06:41:15.297', '2026-05-29 06:41:15.297'), ('cmpqk65bn002zqo0kt2qbtxxm', 'cmpqk33a6002bqo0km6uustxf', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"senior devloper","turns":[{"id":"cmpqk63vl002dqo0kt1scztiq","message":"Hello","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:46:06.370Z","sessionId":"cmpqk33a6002bqo0km6uustxf","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmpqk63vl002eqo0kkxxwl2o3","message":"Hi Shubham, this is Sana, and I''ll be conducting your interview today. Let''s jump right in. Can you start by telling me about yourself?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:46:06.370Z","sessionId":"cmpqk33a6002bqo0km6uustxf","orderIndex":1},{"id":"cmpqk63vl002fqo0kpga3qh7s","message":"Great, thank you for sharing that. Now, could you walk me through your most recent work experience and the key responsibilities you had in that role?","speaker":"