.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:46:06.370Z","sessionId":"cmpqk33a6002bqo0km6uustxf","orderIndex":11},{"id":"cmpqk63vl002pqo0k931o5z51","message":"Understood. Let''s wrap up with this: why do you think you''re a good fit for this product designer role?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:46:06.370Z","sessionId":"cmpqk33a6002bqo0km6uustxf","orderIndex":12},{"id":"cmpqk63vl002qqo0kqcq3ukco","message":"I am a good fit.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:46:06.370Z","sessionId":"cmpqk33a6002bqo0km6uustxf","orderIndex":13},{"id":"cmpqk63vl002rqo0kihsq2pr6","message":"I know that.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:46:06.370Z","sessionId":"cmpqk33a6002bqo0km6uustxf","orderIndex":14},{"id":"cmpqk63vl002sqo0kkemot7q3","message":"Got it. Thank you for your time today. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:46:06.370Z","sessionId":"cmpqk33a6002bqo0km6uustxf","orderIndex":15},{"id":"cmpqk63vl002tqo0ktrwa86le","message":"Where do you want to load it?","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:46:06.370Z","sessionId":"cmpqk33a6002bqo0km6uustxf","orderIndex":16},{"id":"cmpqk63vl002uqo0kvcvh3amy","message":"OK.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:46:06.370Z","sessionId":"cmpqk33a6002bqo0km6uustxf","orderIndex":17},{"id":"cmpqk63vl002vqo0ki3xk5f5h","message":"Take care, Shubham. All the best.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T06:46:06.370Z","sessionId":"cmpqk33a6002bqo0km6uustxf","orderIndex":18}],"domain":"product designer","keySkills":["UI Design","React"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"product designer","mandatoryQuestions":["tell me your self"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-05-29 06:46:08.243', '2026-05-29 06:46:08.243'), ('cmpqkyece003sqo0kd7iqhtmt', 'cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"senior devloper","turns":[{"id":"cmpqkycs50037qo0kqf7fntr3","message":"Hello.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmpqkycs50038qo0krsw5nghe","message":"Hello Shubham, my name is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today. Let’s dive right in. Can you start by telling me about yourself?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":1},{"id":"cmpqkycs50039qo0kmnu1g6yw","message":"Sure. Can you please tell me a bit more about your professional background and what brings you to this interview today?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":2},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003aqo0kz16r94hs","message":"Yes, I have been a product designer for a few companies. I have done UI design, physical product design, and software designing. My previous company used to make 3D printed products, so I was the product design lead for that. I have developed almost 10 to 15 products for that company in the education sector as well as in the manufacturing domain for mechanical systems.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":3},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003bqo0kqayvemzx","message":"Got it. Thanks for that overview. Let’s dive a bit deeper—can you tell me about your experience specifically with UI design?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":4},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003cqo0kepif706k","message":"Yes, so UI design I have done for development of the EdTech platform that was required for my company. It was for the age group of 3 to 10 years, basically school-going kids. It was also an e-commerce platform, so the UI was user-friendly and it involved components that are lightweight and appealing to the kids.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":5},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003dqo0k99ouhosv","message":"Understood. How did you handle creating user-friendly designs for that young age group?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":6},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003eqo0k56futn5q","message":"Yes, that''s it.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":7},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003fqo0k4njxm8f5","message":"So for that, we took the reference of Duolingo, which has a proper documentation of how a UI component should be. Then we also took a reference of Kiviko, which is having its own platform for a similar business. Then we experimented with a lot of different themes and components and did user testing with different sample groups and control groups to understand the responses and the interaction of our target customers. That is how we did.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":8},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003gqo0kh1zu0gho","message":"Thanks for sharing that. Let’s move on—tell me about your experience using React in your projects.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":9},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003hqo0ku3rvnw0i","message":"So I have been using React.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":10},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003iqo0kfvmtn2x9","message":"To a great extent, all my UI designs have been based on React. Previously, I was using JavaScript and HTML and CSS, but then React gives you the flexibility and reusability more than HTML and CSS. Also, you have a lot of predefined components in its library. It is a very huge repository of components that can be reused. So with those React components, I developed this platform, used its menu bar to the header footer, predefined functions, and also used Angular at places where I was finding it difficult to, you know, integrate components with the backend. So React has been extensively used in my development of the platform, especially for the interactive part or the gamification part where the users interact with the platform to play games and earn points, earn coins especially.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":11},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003jqo0kbwq7qr04","message":"All right. One final question—why are you interested in this senior developer role now?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":12},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003kqo0krlfy0qzj","message":"Then we had to use a lot of React components in our e-commerce web page to make it more interactive. The shopping experience should be much more fun and intuitive for the users. So React was used there as well. We also used React 3D components for the kids section, especially for the younger age group, so that they find it more attractive and have fun playing with the components. Also, React was also used on our mobile web pages where we built web applications for the mobile use cases. Yeah, that''s it for my React experience.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":13},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003lqo0kbvktmik7","message":"No, I mean, you have only four to five questions to ask. I thought the interview would go on for much longer. So basically, my experience with React has also been extended, not just for web applications, but beyond web applications as in, you know, for mobile applications where Java especially is used extensively. So, yeah.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":14},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003mqo0kwq87n758","message":"Understood. Thanks for clarifying. One final question: why do you think you''re a strong fit for this senior developer role?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":15},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003nqo0kaepf2gjs","message":"Okay, so see, I have worked on the customer experience side, the backend side also to some extent, and understand user pain points when we have working on the UI portions. So I feel software development is something where I can fit in as a senior software developer. My work experience is almost around seven to eight years. So yeah, I believe I have vast experience in the required domains of this role.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":16},{"id":"cmpqkycs5003oqo0k6vi8bv61","message":"Thank you for that. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T07:08:04.277Z","sessionId":"cmpqkojyd0035qo0kj4n146bc","orderIndex":17}],"domain":"product designer","keySkills":["UI Design","React"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"product designer","mandatoryQuestions":["tell me your self"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-05-29 07:08:06.302', '2026-05-29 07:08:06.302'), ('cmpqmw6me004sqo0kbeki59to', 'cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"The Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service) will be responsible for driving revenue growth through corporate rate contracts and strategic service agreements. This role requires a blend of business development, high-level negotiation, and seamless lifecycle management—ensuring that service delivery aligns with our reputation for excellence.\\n________________________________________\\nKey Respon","turns":[{"id":"cmpqmw5770044qo0koxght8zu","message":"Hello.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmpqmw5770045qo0k8ohf955z","message":"Hello Shubham, my name is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today. Let’s dive right in. To start, could you briefly introduce your current role and your main responsibilities?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":1},{"id":"cmpqmw5770046qo0ky4ic3rno","message":"Great, thank you for sharing that. Now, can you tell me about a challenging project you recently worked on and how you handled it?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":2},{"id":"cmpqmw5770047qo0k3g1jc7o7","message":"Yes, I work on a project called Smart Engine. Smart Engine is about database management.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":3},{"id":"cmpqmw5770048qo0kzcsqbuz4","message":"It involves storing data, then there are different systems for which you capture data based on the projects and the information that''s stored. There are multiple stakeholders involved, almost like 15 to 20 people.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":4},{"id":"cmpqmw5770049qo0kl5sokdgy","message":"The data is also scattered. Some, yeah, some are kept on computers, some in files, some on loose papers.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":5},{"id":"cmpqmw577004aqo0kqu0w10dr","message":"There are data in the form of drawings on hard papers, there are information stored in PDFs, in Excel, in text, in emails, and so on.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":6},{"id":"cmpqmw577004bqo0k9ni1d9ff","message":"Understood.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":7},{"id":"cmpqmw577004cqo0kmntw7sv0","message":"So all the information available in the database was very scattered.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":8},{"id":"cmpqmw577004dqo0kbtn287zc","message":"It took us almost 10 to 15 years to collect all the information, then clean the data based on our requirement.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":9},{"id":"cmpqmw577004eqo0k3hkogfuq","message":"structure the data as per the new resource and the new requirement. We had to involve around 50 to 60 employees just for cleaning purpose. Then experts were hired to make, to conclude which data is useful and which is not useful. This took a lot of time.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":10},{"id":"cmpqmw577004fqo0kcihk27p2","message":"Thank you for that explanation. Let’s move on. How do you price an Annual Maintenance Contract, or AMC contract, in your service business?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":11},{"id":"cmpqmw577004gqo0kwa21lc98","message":"Then, after all the cleaning is done, you have to make the requirements as good as possible. So you have to create linkages between the different systems that are there, map each every requirement with every variable. You look for optimization opportunities so that the number of variables and the database is as small as possible and it gives you outcome as large as possible.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":12},{"id":"cmpqmw577004hqo0ksowg7vtj","message":"AMC contracts are priced based on hundreds of different factors. It includes understanding customer requirements, defining the scope of the contract, the services that are to be provided to the customers is listed down, and the timeline for which the service will be given.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":13},{"id":"cmpqmw577004iqo0kft93sqti","message":"We will start calculating all the resources that will be needed, hard and soft resources, the infrastructure that will be needed, the hourly as well as fixed costs that will be incurred in providing the service. Then, is there any maintenance required? How frequent is the response time required by the customer?","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":14},{"id":"cmpqmw577004jqo0kwl6z41xo","message":"Got it. Now, what factors do you consider while preparing a service proposal for a corporate client?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":15},{"id":"cmpqmw577004kqo0k887ocakf","message":"How many requirements are the dynamic requirements and how many are static, that also is important while deciding the pricing of the AMC contract. So based on all these requirements, we decide on what should be the pricing. Also, what is taken into account is the amount of revenue that the customer can potentially generate for us. So based on that, we can give clients better pricing and attractive discount so that it is win-win situation for both the client and our business. So service AMC contracts are usually long-term contracts, so the pricing decision-making itself takes usually four to five months.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":16},{"id":"cmpqmw577004lqo0kgffbfhcp","message":"Understood. Now, what factors do you consider while preparing a service proposal for a corporate client?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":17},{"id":"cmpqmw577004mqo0km1mjyjg0","message":"While preparing a service proposal for a corporate client, so first of all, we do the bidding for the contract.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":18},{"id":"cmpqmw577004nqo0k5sccpv6u","message":"that we want to take, the bidding process can be in the form of Swiss auction or a reverse auction or whatever it is. The proposal that we prepare also depends on the type of option that is going to take place.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":19},{"id":"cmpqmw577004oqo0kc9bnfnwi","message":"What we take into account is that the fixed non-refundable cost that should go in shouldn''t be a big loss to our company, as well as while preparing the proposal, we make sure that the technical requirements of the contracts are checked and included in our proposal with due diligence and with a factor of safety of 3.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-29T08:02:20.371Z","sessionId":"cmpqmiia1003yqo0k0mda2gfg","orderIndex":20}],"domain":"Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business)","keySkills":["•\\tNegotiation","•\\tCommunication","•\\tStrategic Planning","•\\tContract Management","B2B Business Development"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business)","mandatoryQuestions":["How do you price an AMC contract?","What factors do you consider while preparing a service proposal for a corporate client?","How do you calculate profitability for a long-term service contract?","What KPIs would you track for service delivery performance?","How do you assess service requirements during a site visit?"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-05-29 08:02:22.214', '2026-05-29 08:02:22.214'), ('cmpth2nhv0060qo0kk9qneyi9', 'cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"The Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service) will be responsible for driving revenue growth through corporate rate contracts and strategic service agreements. This role requires a blend of business development, high-level negotiation, and seamless lifecycle management—ensuring that service delivery aligns with our reputation for excellence.\\n________________________________________\\nKey Respon","turns":[{"id":"cmpth2lvt0054qo0kxed2gva8","message":"Hello A, my name is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today for the Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business) role. Let’s dive right in. Can you start by telling me a bit about your most recent role and your key responsibilities there?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmpth2lvt0055qo0kpjlnoe0p","message":"Thank you for sharing that. Could you describe one major challenge you faced in that role and how you handled it, particularly in terms of driving sales growth?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":1},{"id":"cmpth2lvt0056qo0krakewm0t","message":"Hi, dasena, wie ist es heute?","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":2},{"id":"cmpth2lvt0057qo0k4jxjjkhx","message":"Understood. How did you approach","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":3},{"id":"cmpth2lvt0058qo0kx1iascgx","message":"So I would like to say that I have handled the role of cell segregative where I was responsible to sell the franchise business of one of the F&B brand.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":4},{"id":"cmpth2lvt0059qo0k3p7ruy4n","message":"So there I was responsible to identify the potential clients.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":5},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005aqo0kmnlq2duc","message":"Arrange scheduled meeting with them and make them aware about the franchise model, how it works, and how it can be beneficial for the customers. And basis on that, if there are any questions, some details, clarifications required, I used to give them and then we used to close the deal.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":6},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005bqo0kp4un9eh4","message":"So that was the key role and responsibilities of my role.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":7},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005cqo0ky62tk6ez","message":"Understood. Now let me ask: how do you price an Annual Maintenance Contract, or AMC contract, for a corporate client?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":8},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005dqo0kb54n24f6","message":"So annual maintenance contract is priced basis on the product price which we have given to them.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":9},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005eqo0kisirjmjm","message":"Got it. What factors do you consider while preparing a service proposal for a corporate client?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":10},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005fqo0khcpjnlye","message":"And after that, this is on the service what we provide during the annual period.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":11},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005gqo0kfc8dts7n","message":"So while preparing the service proposal, we have to look into the current market rates going on in the market, what is our key features or USB points for which we are charging them.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":12},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005hqo0k0voerbrv","message":"All right. How do you calculate profitability for a long-term service contract?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":13},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005iqo0k3gg1xddd","message":"And profit margin, consistently profit margin, we used to charge the or the.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":14},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005jqo0koskw9an9","message":"Hello everyone.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":15},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005kqo0kl6g8xkzd","message":"Take your time. Could you walk me through how you calculate profitability for a long-term service contract?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":16},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005lqo0knt9lk1fk","message":"So profitability from the long-term service contract is through loyalty of the customer for a longer period.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":17},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005mqo0kaonskhpg","message":"So this is on the number of services provided, number of hours given to the service of the client, and the cost incurred. So the difference of these two, we use to calculate the...","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":18},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005nqo0kpuamfz0q","message":"Profitability of the long-term service contract.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":19},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005oqo0kakpdgjeg","message":"Thank you. What key performance indicators would you track for service delivery performance?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":20},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005pqo0ksdabrl90","message":"So service delivery performance there are two major parameters key to that is one is timeliness, how timely service has been provided. So the TAT is very important here. The second is the quality of service. So the quality of service based on the feedback from the client and how satisfied the client is with the service.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":21},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005qqo0khf7hbxuz","message":"Here is another key indicator.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":22},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005rqo0kd2h2uh2l","message":"Understood. Now, how do you assess service requirements during a site visit?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":23},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005sqo0krw1b41o7","message":"And definitely cost is one of the parameters. We have to, what is the cost of service to the client on each performance? These are the main major three performance indicators for the service business.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":24},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005tqo0kg8hy9w59","message":"So assessing the cybersecurity parameter at the site visit is by preparing the complete checklist of what things has to be assessed or audited. So one should be well prepared for that audit. And once you go there, do the audit thoroughly, systematically, and record the","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":25},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005uqo0k4e8y8z6b","message":"the differences or the gaps, and basis on that, suggest the solution and the","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":26},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005vqo0kv3o08uyn","message":"Thank you, A. That covers what we needed. I appreciate your time today. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":27},{"id":"cmpth2lvt005wqo0k04gw8klw","message":"Services which can be carried out to complete the service part.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-05-31T07:42:42.761Z","sessionId":"cmptgtoss004yqo0kyew090wv","orderIndex":28}],"domain":"Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business)","keySkills":["•\\tNegotiation","•\\tCommunication","•\\tStrategic Planning","•\\tContract Management","B2B Business Development"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business)","mandatoryQuestions":["How do you price an AMC contract?","What factors do you consider while preparing a service proposal for a corporate client?","How do you calculate profitability for a long-term service contract?","What KPIs would you track for service delivery performance?","How do you assess service requirements during a site visit?"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-05-31 07:42:44.851', '2026-05-31 07:42:44.851'), ('cmpva068c000eqn0jvxkp23qi', 'cmpv9z1rw0006qn0jdi4hsfaq', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"business anaytics","turns":[{"id":"cmpva04u60008qn0j1g07kyed","message":"我們壓在這裡。","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-01T14:00:22.398Z","sessionId":"cmpv9z1rw0006qn0jdi4hsfaq","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmpva04u60009qn0jlk3wtev5","message":"Hi Niv, my name is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today. Let’s jump right in. Could you start by telling","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-01T14:00:22.398Z","sessionId":"cmpv9z1rw0006qn0jdi4hsfaq","orderIndex":1},{"id":"cmpva04u6000aqn0j5s0zh8ya","message":"Hi Niv, this is Sana from Test. Let’s begin. First question: Can you tell me about a challenge you faced at work and how you handled it?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-01T14:00:22.398Z","sessionId":"cmpv9z1rw0006qn0jdi4hsfaq","orderIndex":2}],"domain":"business anaytics","keySkills":["business anaytics Fundamentals","Problem Solving & Judgment","Domain Expertise"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"business anaytics","mandatoryQuestions":["Tell us about your background and how it maps to this role."]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-06-01 14:00:24.205', '2026-06-01 14:00:24.205'), ('cmpwuji5x000rl10kyfhkuxts', 'cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"Graduate trainee","turns":[{"id":"cmpwujgmb000al10kwwhreleu","message":"Hello.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000bl10kqkx8vg4v","message":"Hello Shubham, my name is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today for the Junior Mechanical Engineer role. Let''s dive right in. \\n\\nTo start, can you explain the fundamental laws of thermodynamics?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":1},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000cl10k63blwvt0","message":"Go ahead,","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":2},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000dl10k3t5ladrq","message":"Yes.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":3},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000el10klj1p41t8","message":"Thank you for that. And what about the first law of thermodynamics?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":4},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000fl10knmqldcgz","message":"So we have four laws of thermodynamics. The first one is the zeroth law, which is about equilibrium of temperatures. The second law is the law of heat and work. It says that heat can be converted into work and work can be converted into heat. The third law is of entropy, which talks about every system has the tendency to increase entropy.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":5},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000gl10kf3a6pavs","message":"Just a quick reminder: the first law deals with energy conservation. Could you explain it briefly?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":6},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000hl10kbctnph53","message":"啊","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":7},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000il10kwo93ciro","message":"Yes, so the first law is about energy conservation, which says energy cannot be created neither destroyed, it can only be transferred from one form to the other.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":8},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000jl10kt5q4z8ed","message":"Good. Now let’s move on. Can you describe a common manufacturing process you’ve worked with or studied?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":9},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000kl10kjeg5zb6y","message":"I''ve studied about a lot of manufacturing processes. To name a few, I have learned about welding, then lathe processes, then casting, then some other processes like sheet molding, basically rolling process, then you have folding process or wire forming processes. Then you have, there are conventional as well as non-conventional manufacturing processes. So conventional manufacturing processes are the ones that I talked about. The non-conventional manufacturing processes are like 3D printing or EDM or any other method.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":10},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000ll10k8950zufr","message":"Understood. Let’s narrow it down—can you pick one of those processes and explain it in more detail?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":11},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000ml10kpv5ep5g1","message":"Yeah, so let''s talk about casting. So casting process involves melting of the raw metal. So basically, you melt the metal first and then you pour it in predefined structures which are called as dies. And then the dies are basically made of either ceramic material or some other material which is not metal. Then you pour the molten metal into the die and then you allow it to cool once the pouring is cooled, you get the final part which is the casting product. For example, valves or a lot of complex machines devices are built of casting. For example, engines or rods which are used in power transmission valves.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":12},{"id":"cmpwujgmb000nl10k1ui61ms2","message":"Thank you for that explanation. Now, can you tell me what you know about additive manufacturing and how it’s different from traditional methods?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-02T16:23:02.628Z","sessionId":"cmpwubgnd0006l10k8iaoyz81","orderIndex":13}],"domain":"Junior mechanical engineer","keySkills":["Thermodynamics","Manufacturing"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"Junior mechanical engineer","mandatoryQuestions":["Laws of thermodyanmics","manufacturing process","additive manufacturing"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-06-02 16:23:04.629', '2026-06-02 16:23:04.629'), ('cmpxqgto7001ml10kqwznpewu', 'cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"The Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service) will be responsible for driving revenue growth through corporate rate contracts and strategic service agreements. This role requires a blend of business development, high-level negotiation, and seamless lifecycle management—ensuring that service delivery aligns with our reputation for excellence.\\n________________________________________\\nKey Respon","turns":[{"id":"cmpxqgs310011l10k8dvl0m6w","message":"Hello.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmpxqgs310012l10ktejw0snf","message":"Hello Shubham, my name is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today for the Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business) role. Let’s dive right in. Could you start by telling me how you approach pricing an Annual Maintenance Contract?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":1},{"id":"cmpxqgs310013l10kahnb2wc8","message":"Can you repeat?","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":2},{"id":"cmpxqgs310014l10kzkx7vs4n","message":"Certainly. How do you approach pricing an Annual Maintenance Contract?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":3},{"id":"cmpxqgs310015l10k9ud01t59","message":"Understood. Go ahead and share","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":4},{"id":"cmpxqgs310016l10kwhtwhu4x","message":"Pricing the contracts is","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":5},{"id":"cmpxqgs310017l10kfwyue5kr","message":"Got it. What factors do you consider while preparing a service proposal for a corporate client?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":6},{"id":"cmpxqgs310018l10kna98f4l3","message":"It is a simple task for me. I take into consideration all the long-term services that I provide to the clients and also the resources that will be utilized, consider the time frame, and the change management that we have to do. All these factors make us decide what is the pricing.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":7},{"id":"cmpxqgs310019l10kn9cs24r4","message":"For a corporate client, it''s a complex task. So while preparing a service proposal, we first of all take into consideration contract requirements, the scope of the service that is required by the client. Based on the scope, we map the offerings that we are going to provide and we also provide a resolution sheet for the clients so that they can let us know the shortcomings or what additional offerings that they are really looking into. We also provide a cost sheet in the proposal as well as there will be the cost sheet and the timeline in the proposal or the execution and the service duration.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":8},{"id":"cmpxqgs31001al10k3fm4y3pm","message":"Understood. Now, how do you calculate profitability for a long-term service contract?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":9},{"id":"cmpxqgs31001bl10kmc18xcib","message":"Profitability for a long-term service contract is a much complex task because you have to consider the revenue sources and then the expenses linked to each source. So profit is basically revenue minus expenses. So profitability consideration, we also check what is the We consider the growth rate that will be included during the course of the service. What are the additional opportunities that we can get which will be a source of revenue for us with the client and with the growth, the cost cutting, and the additional opportunity, we do our profitability calculations.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":10},{"id":"cmpxqgs31001cl10kezns70ex","message":"Thank you. What KPIs would you track for service delivery performance?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":11},{"id":"cmpxqgs31001dl10kowsuivdl","message":"Service delivery.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":12},{"id":"cmpxqgs31001el10kz35ngdcx","message":"Just a reminder, take your time. What are the key performance indicators you focus on for service delivery?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":13},{"id":"cmpxqgs31001fl10ko8j28lsi","message":"For service delivery, we focus on KPIs like resolution time, then effectiveness, efficiency of our task, productivity of our resources, and the downtime that occurs.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":14},{"id":"cmpxqgs31001gl10khjfbg087","message":"Understood. How do you assess service requirements during a site visit?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":15},{"id":"cmpxqgs31001hl10kah523uez","message":"We interact with the customers and the people there, understand their pain points, and take note of each and every issue that is going on there. And based on that, we make an assessment.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":16},{"id":"cmpxqgs31001il10ki6y40awa","message":"Thank you, Shubham. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-03T07:16:45.229Z","sessionId":"cmpxq8xkk000vl10kvapoxipn","orderIndex":17}],"domain":"Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business)","keySkills":["•\\tNegotiation","•\\tCommunication","•\\tStrategic Planning","•\\tContract Management","B2B Business Development"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business)","mandatoryQuestions":["How do you price an AMC contract?","What factors do you consider while preparing a service proposal for a corporate client?","How do you calculate profitability for a long-term service contract?","What KPIs would you track for service delivery performance?","How do you assess service requirements during a site visit?"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-06-03 07:16:47.287', '2026-06-03 07:16:47.287'), ('cmpzhw8pi000klk0khky798yw', 'cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"Graduate trainee","turns":[{"id":"cmpzhw79z0005lk0kbaypai7d","message":"Hallo.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T12:52:20.567Z","sessionId":"cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmpzhw79z0006lk0km21p4nh2","message":"Hello Shubham, I''m Sana, and I''ll be conducting your interview today for the Junior Mechanical Engineer role. Let’s jump right in. Could you start by explaining the main laws of thermodynamics?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T12:52:20.567Z","sessionId":"cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr","orderIndex":1},{"id":"cmpzhw79z0007lk0kz2091zbc","message":"There are four laws of thermodynamics in the zeroth law, which is about Equilibrium of temperature The first law which is about conservation of energy the second law That talks about entropy change and the fourth law which says that the absolute entropy When the entropy reaches zero State is totally at still","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T12:52:20.567Z","sessionId":"cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr","orderIndex":2},{"id":"cmpzhw79z0008lk0k16yjut90","message":"Thank you. That covers the four laws. Now, can you walk me through a common manufacturing process you’ve worked with or studied?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T12:52:20.567Z","sessionId":"cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr","orderIndex":3},{"id":"cmpzhw79z0009lk0ko70wsxu2","message":"I have studied about casting process.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T12:52:20.567Z","sessionId":"cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr","orderIndex":4},{"id":"cmpzhw79z000alk0ktqmky6h1","message":"Understood. Could you give me a brief description of how the casting process works?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T12:52:20.567Z","sessionId":"cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr","orderIndex":5},{"id":"cmpzhw79z000blk0ka924jb48","message":"Yes, in the casting process, molten metal is poured into a die which is then solidified and then allowed to cool. Once the metal cools in the die, the part is taken out and then it is post-processed that is polishing is done and grinding is done and you obtain the final product.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T12:52:20.567Z","sessionId":"cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr","orderIndex":6},{"id":"cmpzhw79z000clk0kkxj7baz4","message":"All right, that’s a good overview. Now, can you explain what additive manufacturing is and how it''s different from traditional methods?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T12:52:20.567Z","sessionId":"cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr","orderIndex":7},{"id":"cmpzhw79z000dlk0ka964uy36","message":"additive manufacturing is basically a non-traditional manufacturing process in which material is deposited layer by layer to form the final product. It is different from other conventional process as most of the traditional processes are subtractive manufacturing that is the product is cut or subtract or material is removed from the raw material and to get final product in additive manufacturing. The material is deposited or added layer by layer to get the final product.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T12:52:20.567Z","sessionId":"cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr","orderIndex":8},{"id":"cmpzhw79z000elk0ktozu64zc","message":"Got it. Thanks for that explanation. One last question: why do you want to pursue this role as a junior mechanical engineer?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T12:52:20.567Z","sessionId":"cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr","orderIndex":9},{"id":"cmpzhw79z000flk0kjvva0jqo","message":"So I am completing my undergraduation B.Tech in Mechanical Engineering and I have I am very passionate about Working on mechanical systems and doing engineering In engineering product design and work with Mechanical parts","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T12:52:20.567Z","sessionId":"cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr","orderIndex":10},{"id":"cmpzhw79z000glk0kfww7rug1","message":"Thank you for sharing that. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T12:52:20.567Z","sessionId":"cmpzhpewo0001lk0k3kdkuxjr","orderIndex":11}],"domain":"Junior mechanical engineer","keySkills":["Thermodynamics","Manufacturing"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"Junior mechanical engineer","mandatoryQuestions":["Laws of thermodyanmics","manufacturing process","additive manufacturing"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-06-04 12:52:22.422', '2026-06-04 12:52:22.422'), ('cmpzicyes001jlk0kyuq8zrqm', 'cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"senior devloper","turns":[{"id":"cmpzicvsw000slk0kaxk95zro","message":"Hello.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmpzicvsw000tlk0k5rr2rc8s","message":"Hi Ram, my name is Sana and I''ll be conducting your interview today. Let''s jump right in—tell me about yourself.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":1},{"id":"cmpzicvsw000ulk0k3kcm179h","message":"I am a product designer, I have 4 years of experience both in hardware and software products. I have used 3D modeling, 2D graphics and drawing tools as well as prototyping, prototyping softwares for designing software applications or software products. I have worked for big clients like Google and Apple and also freelancing for educational customers.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":2},{"id":"cmpzicvsw000vlk0kk6hxibey","message":"Thank you for sharing that. Can you tell me more about your current role and what you''re focusing on right now?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":3},{"id":"cmpzicvsw000wlk0k27f0yemv","message":"Currently my job role is to make MVPs for my customers. So when a client has some business idea, I convert that idea to a basic design and then convert it to minimum viable product or an MVP. Based on that, then my team starts developing the prototype which is then given to the customers and then the project continues from there on. Currently I am developing a bowling machine that is used in cricket for batting practice.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":4},{"id":"cmpzicvsw000xlk0knnjoqfr3","message":"Got it, that’s interesting. Let’s dive deeper—can you walk me through your experience with UI design in your projects?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":5},{"id":"cmpzicvsw000ylk0ktz9e6rrj","message":"Yes, so I have designed UI for e-commerce websites, as well as gaming mobile applications. I have also worked on UI design for educational edtech startups and a few general applications for Android and Apple.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":6},{"id":"cmpzicvsw000zlk0kk3sdxole","message":"Understood. And what specific tools or frameworks do you usually rely on for your UI design work?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":7},{"id":"cmpzicvsw0010lk0k24ko9x8h","message":"Great, thanks. How about your experience with React—can you tell me about that?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":8},{"id":"cmpzicvsw0011lk0k9vp562by","message":"For wireframing, I use Figma.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":9},{"id":"cmpzicvsw0012lk0kcoqb2gmn","message":"If React isn''t part of your main toolkit, that’s fine. Could you share if you’ve had any involvement in front-end development or collaborating with developers using it?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":10},{"id":"cmpzicvsw0013lk0kvquu3a6i","message":"and","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":11},{"id":"cmpzicvsw0014lk0kco006r0g","message":"Yeah, so I have all I have used react for developing web applications myself, and it has been limited to general and simple webpages and I''ve used it to basically leverage the ready-made library that we have and the UI elements that are available in react which can be reproduced and reused multiple times.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":12},{"id":"cmpzicvsw0015lk0kry0crtum","message":"Got it, thank you for that. Now, what’s the most challenging design problem you’ve solved recently?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":13},{"id":"cmpzicvsw0016lk0kegg9dvx6","message":"The most challenging design problem was basically the payment gateway, which was plugged in into an e-commerce platform. So the entire user flow or the product flow was not very user-friendly and intuitive. So we tried to work around with around four to five different designs where the user searches for the product and is is intuitively pushed forward to make a purchase call and how after doing A-B testing with available designs, we finally narrowed down to two major designs and that has been a success after that.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":14},{"id":"cmpzicvsw0017lk0kzku39mxo","message":"Thanks for sharing that. What was the key reason you chose the final design over the others?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":15},{"id":"cmpzicvsw0018lk0kfpvxvqzq","message":"Understood. That makes sense. One final","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":16},{"id":"cmpzicvsw0019lk0kdmm20dgw","message":"So, the metrics that we tracked to finalize the design was the conversion ratio of user landing on the page and making the purchase decision and the sample size was approximately 150 users per design and keeping the product offerings very much same. So, based on the conversion ratio that we got, the one that we finalized, the conversion ratio was very high as well as repeat customers coming back to our platform and spending time also increased relatively for the final design, selected design.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":17},{"id":"cmpzicvsw001alk0k8crw146l","message":"Thank you, Ram. That concludes our interview. I appreciate your time today. Best of luck with the hiring process.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":18},{"id":"cmpzicvsw001blk0kzd7c57st","message":"Yeah.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":19},{"id":"cmpzicvsw001clk0k0gner28p","message":"Thank you.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":20},{"id":"cmpzicvsw001dlk0kikwph2ad","message":"You''re very welcome. Take care and goodbye.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":21},{"id":"cmpzicvsw001elk0k6obap3f4","message":"Close the interview.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":22},{"id":"cmpzicvsw001flk0kr4hp6c09","message":"Understood. The interview is now closed. Goodbye.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:05:18.848Z","sessionId":"cmpzi19xw000qlk0kd79lr0o7","orderIndex":23}],"domain":"product designer","keySkills":["UI Design","React"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"product designer","mandatoryQuestions":["tell me your self"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-06-04 13:05:22.228', '2026-06-04 13:05:22.228'), ('cmpzirhy7001xlk0kqvaxwhlk', 'cmpziqbu8001qlk0kdozyipp3', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"hr","turns":[{"id":"cmpzirghk001slk0k24fajgh1","message":"Hello.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:16:38.841Z","sessionId":"cmpziqbu8001qlk0kdozyipp3","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmpzirghk001tlk0k4ypocdtf","message":"Hello, Niv. My name is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today for the HR role. Let’s dive right in. Can you start by telling us about your background and how it maps to this role?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-04T13:16:38.841Z","sessionId":"cmpziqbu8001qlk0kdozyipp3","orderIndex":1}],"domain":"hr","keySkills":["hr Fundamentals","Problem Solving & Judgment","Domain Expertise"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"hr","mandatoryQuestions":["Tell us about your background and how it maps to this role."]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-06-04 13:16:40.735', '2026-06-04 13:16:40.735'), ('cmpzj01qy