'2026-06-11 11:17:52.04'), ('cmq9fa1ok000jpb01mi5rfkxe', 'cmq9f315i0001pb01dpggfzha', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"The Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service) will be responsible for driving revenue growth through corporate rate contracts and strategic service agreements. This role requires a blend of business development, high-level negotiation, and seamless lifecycle management—ensuring that service delivery aligns with our reputation for excellence.\\n________________________________________\\nKey Respon","turns":[{"id":"cmq9fa0990007pb01xc50iu9w","message":"Hi Ram, this is Sana from Test. Let''s begin. Can you tell me about a time when you faced a difficult challenge at work and how you handled it?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:36:47.565Z","sessionId":"cmq9f315i0001pb01dpggfzha","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmq9fa0990008pb01ofi2zzd5","message":"If there is any glitch or issue, you can show the error here. Okay. And from that error, you can see where there is a problem and where there is an issue. Okay. Mostly this happens. Yes. It will be written in the console that what is the issue and because of which it is coming.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:36:47.565Z","sessionId":"cmq9f315i0001pb01dpggfzha","orderIndex":1},{"id":"cmq9fa0990009pb01yzj2g8nl","message":"I’m sorry, but we need to continue in English only for this interview. Let''s keep going. Could you describe how you typically price an AMC contract?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:36:47.565Z","sessionId":"cmq9f315i0001pb01dpggfzha","orderIndex":2},{"id":"cmq9fa099000apb018406o1fc","message":"I was talking in English for so long.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:36:47.565Z","sessionId":"cmq9f315i0001pb01dpggfzha","orderIndex":3},{"id":"cmq9fa099000bpb01rip0gbzw","message":"Ram, let’s continue in English only. Now, tell me, how do you price an AMC contract?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:36:47.565Z","sessionId":"cmq9f315i0001pb01dpggfzha","orderIndex":4},{"id":"cmq9fa099000cpb01leor879q","message":"But I was speaking in English and you didn''t respond for almost 4 minutes. What happened to you?","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:36:47.565Z","sessionId":"cmq9f315i0001pb01dpggfzha","orderIndex":5},{"id":"cmq9fa099000dpb01y3nnxz8e","message":"I understand, Ram. Let’s keep going now. How do you price an AMC contract?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:36:47.565Z","sessionId":"cmq9f315i0001pb01dpggfzha","orderIndex":6},{"id":"cmq9fa099000epb01qv545mr9","message":"Yes. Okay. So.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:36:47.565Z","sessionId":"cmq9f315i0001pb01dpggfzha","orderIndex":7},{"id":"cmq9fa099000fpb01iao3v28i","message":"Ram, let’s stay in English. Now, how do you price an AMC contract?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:36:47.565Z","sessionId":"cmq9f315i0001pb01dpggfzha","orderIndex":8}],"domain":"Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business)","keySkills":["•\\tNegotiation","•\\tCommunication","•\\tStrategic Planning","•\\tContract Management","B2B Business Development"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business)","mandatoryQuestions":["How do you price an AMC contract?","What factors do you consider while preparing a service proposal for a corporate client?","How do you calculate profitability for a long-term service contract?","What KPIs would you track for service delivery performance?","How do you assess service requirements during a site visit?"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-06-11 11:36:49.412', '2026-06-11 11:36:49.412'), ('cmq9fojr8001jpb014y8u02jf', 'cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"The Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service) will be responsible for driving revenue growth through corporate rate contracts and strategic service agreements. This role requires a blend of business development, high-level negotiation, and seamless lifecycle management—ensuring that service delivery aligns with our reputation for excellence.\\n________________________________________\\nKey Respon","turns":[{"id":"cmq9foi8p000ypb01mz5psb93","message":"Hello Ram, this is Sana from Test. Let’s begin. Can you tell me about a time when you solved a difficult problem at work?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmq9foi8p000zpb01ck8vphaa","message":"Yes, so I was working on a database project, which was to build a dashboard for solving new problems. So, the data that we had of our past projects were in different sources, text, Excel and in hard copied files and drawings. So, what we did is we made it into a single source of input for the dashboard. So, it took a lot of time and we had to employ almost 15 to 20 employees to do the same work.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":1},{"id":"cmq9foi8p0010pb01sjzqt8oo","message":"Thank you for sharing that. Let’s move on. How do you price an AMC contract?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":2},{"id":"cmq9foi8p0011pb01s7cobgh6","message":"What is an AMC contract?","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":3},{"id":"cmq9foi8p0012pb01a6wx049w","message":"An AMC is an Annual Maintenance Contract. Now, how do you go about pricing one?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":4},{"id":"cmq9foi8p0013pb01g2401wey","message":"So, to price an EMC contract, we take into consideration the services that we are going to offer to the clients, the amount of labor that will be required, the resources that will be deployed there, the duration for which the project would be going on. Based on all these considerations, we provide a contract and we price it.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":5},{"id":"cmq9foi8r0014pb01cdmqmflz","message":"Understood. Now, what factors do you consider while preparing a service proposal for a corporate client?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":6},{"id":"cmq9foi8r0015pb017om2jj9n","message":"Factors is basically again, first we look into the requirements of a client, how complex is the requirement for them, the duration for which we will be serving them, the complexity of the project and maybe the amount of resources that has to be deployed, whether we will ask them to work from our location or we have to take people to their location. So those are a few factors on which we collect all the information and then keeping tab on the pricing structure.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":7},{"id":"cmq9foi8r0016pb018zg0td2d","message":"Got it. How do you calculate profitability for a long-term service contract?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":8},{"id":"cmq9foi8r0017pb01jno5n6nu","message":"Sa... Si...","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":9},{"id":"cmq9foi8r0018pb01o6q9m8ec","message":"Take your time. Could you walk me through how you assess the costs and margins to figure out profitability?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":10},{"id":"cmq9foi8r0019pb01vcf0ts2z","message":"We assess the margins if we face difficulties in maintaining our profit margin to the pre-decided value then we start cutting costs and then focus on other growth areas.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":11},{"id":"cmq9foi8r001apb01mc17xs2b","message":"All right. What KPIs would you track for service delivery performance?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":12},{"id":"cmq9foi8r001bpb014t3kers6","message":"Feel free to share a couple of key performance indicators you''d focus on.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":14},{"id":"cmq9foi8r001cpb010qtdsz6i","message":"Productivity, then efficiency and delivery time as well as customer resolution time. These are the KPIs for us to monitor.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":15},{"id":"cmq9foi8r001dpb01ixppxk91","message":"Understood. How do you assess service requirements during a site visit?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":16},{"id":"cmq9foi8r001epb01fjbmlmta","message":"We usually try to interact with as many people as possible at the site, understand their pain points, document them, get the feedback on the proposed solutions and go ahead.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":17},{"id":"cmq9foi8r001fpb01xbjofnxj","message":"Thank you, Ram. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.057Z","sessionId":"cmq9fgeo3000ppb01yvyl1c7m","orderIndex":18}],"domain":"Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business)","keySkills":["•\\tNegotiation","•\\tCommunication","•\\tStrategic Planning","•\\tContract Management","B2B Business Development"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"Senior Executive – Sales & Marketing (Service Business)","mandatoryQuestions":["How do you price an AMC contract?","What factors do you consider while preparing a service proposal for a corporate client?","How do you calculate profitability for a long-term service contract?","What KPIs would you track for service delivery performance?","How do you assess service requirements during a site visit?"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-06-11 11:48:06.019', '2026-06-11 11:48:06.019'), ('cmq9fts0k002bpb018fllw0o3', 'cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"Junior role AWS solution architect","turns":[{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001mpb01kyotewm2","message":"Hello Akshat Singh, this is Sana from the test. Let''s begin. Can you tell me about a challenging project you worked on recently and what your role was?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":0},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001npb011oxdkwem","message":"I worked on two projects. First, I deployed a static website on EC2 using Nuggets. And second, I hosted a website using S3 and CloudFront. This project helped me to understand networking, permission, and deployment.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":1},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001opb01rwzc3fwj","message":"Thanks for sharing that. What was your specific responsibility in the EC2 deployment?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":2},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001ppb01dzrwtddq","message":"Basically, I have worked mainly C2 like a virtual server service that provides a scalable computer resource for hosting applications and websites.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":3},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001qpb01eq3e5a59","message":"Understood. Can you explain how you configured the security groups for that EC2 instance?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":4},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001rpb01bycpic1z","message":"Sorry, I can''t get you um security group are stateful and work at instance level like I don''t think so","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":5},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001spb01ljkwtia7","message":"No problem. Let me clarify. How did you manage the inbound and outbound rules in the security group for your EC2 instance?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":6},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001tpb018alsv9wm","message":"Basically security group and I work on NACL like security group are stateful and work at instance level and NACL are stateless and work at the subnet level.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":7},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001upb01rltbsssz","message":"Got it. Now, tell me about your background and how it maps to this AWS Solutions Architect role.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":8},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001vpb01ujxku3ds","message":"Okay, I''ve completed my VTech in Computer Science and I''m currently building my career in cloud and DevOps. I have been learning in AWS services like EC2, S3, IAM and VPC and implementing them through hands-on projects, I have deployed a static website on EC2 and another website using S3 and CloudFront.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":9},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001wpb01khruo83v","message":"Thank you. How comfortable are you working with designing VPC architectures?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":10},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001xpb01lmsf4cup","message":"VPC is an isolated virtual network where we create subnets, root tables and internet gateways to control traffic security.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":11},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001ypb0193708m75","message":"Understood. Can you give an example of how you''ve handled subnet configuration in a VPC?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":12},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy001zpb016mrrvtw9","message":"Take your time. Even a simple example of how you set up public and private subnets would be fine.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":14},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy0020pb01uegx18o5","message":"All right","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":15},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy0021pb01j44rkgtt","message":"It''s all right. Let’s move on. How have you used IAM to manage access in your projects?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":16},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy0022pb01n3uoypmc","message":"Yeah, I am a role provider temporary credential and are more secure than access key like used to manage a user group role and a permission security following the least privilege principle.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":17},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy0023pb01ch1pbxvr","message":"Thank you for that. One final question: how do you ensure high availability in an S3-based architecture?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":18},{"id":"cmq9ftqiy0024pb013aypmy6c","message":"S3 is provide object storage.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:52:08.074Z","sessionId":"cmq9fmiop000wpb01jv6j4wk0","orderIndex":19},{