oo2ej3l","message":"Let me think about it, identify and access management commonly referred to as IAM is a service responsible for authentication and authorization in AWS. IAM is able administration to secure manage user groups, roles and permissions. Through this organization can control who can access AWS responses and what action they are allowed to perform.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":7,"timestampMs":156610},{"id":"cmqar6ej1001amv01hol419qn","message":"Understood. Can you give a specific example of how you used an IAM role in one of your projects?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":8,"timestampMs":206151},{"id":"cmqar6ej1001bmv01zx519t1x","message":"Basically, database are config with multiple AS development to ensure automatic failover. Static content is served through S3 and CloudFront to improve performance and reduce latency. Monitoring services such as CloudWatch continuously track resources, health and trigger alarm when predefined throws are accessed. Highly available minimizes downtime, improves reliability and ensures uninterrupted services delivery.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":9,"timestampMs":214706},{"id":"cmqar6ej1001cmv01zt0hm32s","message":"Thanks. Let’s clarify—how did you specifically use an IAM role in that setup?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":10,"timestampMs":271961},{"id":"cmqar6ej1001dmv01jpl2rgft","message":"IAM users represent individual identity, groups are collections of users with similar permissions, policies are JSON, document that define permissions, role provides temporary credentials and are generally assigned to AWS services, rather than individual. One of the most important principles followed in IAM is the principle of Least Privilege. According to this principle, users and services should only be granted the minimum permission necessary to perform their task.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":11,"timestampMs":283468},{"id":"cmqar6ej1001emv01trhhkt05","message":"Understood. Let me ask this differently—can you walk me through a real scenario where you assigned an IAM role to an EC2 instance?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":12,"timestampMs":333469},{"id":"cmqar6ej1001fmv01bxvr9pki","message":"Multiple factors as authenticated added additional layer of security by requiring second authentication mechanism. IAM and ROL are widely used to provide secure access between AWS servers without exposing access key. For example, an EC2 instance can access an S3 bucket through an IAM ROL instead of storing credentials inside the applications.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":13,"timestampMs":343712},{"id":"cmqar6ej1001gmv01m77nqc7g","message":"All right, thank you for explaining that. Now, how did you configure networking in a VPC for one of your deployments?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":14,"timestampMs":390583},{"id":"cmqar6ej1001hmv0104z3f2bl","message":"BPC. Amazon Virtual Private Cloud is a logical, isolated virtual network that enables users to surely launch AWS responses. A VPC allows an organization to define their own IP address range, create subnets and configure routing according to their security requirements.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":15,"timestampMs":400012},{"id":"cmqar6ej1001imv01opf0nfmo","message":"Thanks. Can you describe how you set up subnets and routing in your VPC?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":16,"timestampMs":440101},{"id":"cmqar6ej1001jmv019mh9fgtz","message":"subnets and routing subnets and routing divides the VPN into smaller segment public subnet contents resources that require internet access whereas private subnet host resources that should remain inaccessible from public internet such as database state you know you","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":17,"timestampMs":448564},{"id":"cmqar6ej1001kmv01igacz5ku","message":"Thanks for that explanation. How did you configure the internet gateway and route tables in that VPC setup?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":18,"timestampMs":516381},{"id":"cmqar6ej2001lmv01t80kn3al","message":"the tables via routing and all that stuff we on network gateway translation gate cloud networking service that allows so resources in private subnet to access the internet without allowing inbound internet connection to this resources.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":19,"timestampMs":526474},{"id":"cmqar6ej2001mmv01c56owypq","message":"Got it. Let’s move to a final question. How do you ensure high availability when designing a solution using EC2?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-12T09:57:41.005Z","sessionId":"cmqaqskju0010mv01zlahv6lh","orderIndex":20,"timestampMs":578787}],"domain":"AWS Solution architect","keySkills":["EC2","S3","VPC","IAN"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"AWS Solution architect","mandatoryQuestions":["Tell us about your background and how it maps to this role."]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-06-12 09:57:42.848', '2026-06-12 09:57:42.848'), ('cmqask36e002emv01yoayczjy', 'cmqasdu2p0022mv01qafmigqu', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"Graduate trainee","turns":[{"id":"cmqask1kn0026mv01eez6prkv","message":"Hi Shivam, I''m Sana from Test. Let''s dive right in. Can you tell me about a recent project you worked on and what your specific role was?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-12T10:36:17.016Z","sessionId":"cmqasdu2p0022mv01qafmigqu","orderIndex":0,"timestampMs":43},{"id":"cmqask1kn0027mv01m6nqjd9a","message":"So, I worked on a database management project where my responsibility was to prepare a dashboard.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-12T10:36:17.016Z","sessionId":"cmqasdu2p0022mv01qafmigqu","orderIndex":1,"timestampMs":9922},{"id":"cmqask1kn0028mv01ehta8hzf","message":"Thanks for sharing that. Let''s move on to the fundamentals. Can you walk me through the basic laws of thermodynamics?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-12T10:36:17.016Z","sessionId":"cmqasdu2p0022mv01qafmigqu","orderIndex":2,"timestampMs":36615},{"id":"cmqask1kn0029mv01gsy7xf6y","message":"yes we have four laws of thermodynamics zeroth law about temperature equivalence first law conservation of energy second law about entropy and fourth law about absolute entropy you","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-12T10:36:17.016Z","sessionId":"cmqasdu2p0022mv01qafmigqu","orderIndex":3,"timestampMs":45339},{"id":"cmqask1kn002amv010x8iw9ba","message":"Understood. Now, tell me about a manufacturing process you''re familiar with and explain how it works.","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-12T10:36:17.016Z","sessionId":"cmqasdu2p0022mv01qafmigqu","orderIndex":4,"timestampMs":84794}],"domain":"Junior mechanical engineer","keySkills":["Thermodynamics","Manufacturing"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"Junior mechanical engineer","mandatoryQuestions":["Laws of thermodyanmics","manufacturing process","additive manufacturing"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-06-12 10:36:19.095', '2026-06-12 10:36:19.095'), ('cmqc689tf000pmp011324uf38', 'cmqc5xtlv0007mp01nx9s3y6x', 'PENDING', null, '{"topic":"Graduate trainee","turns":[{"id":"cmqc688bg000bmp018y8up8uc","message":"Hello 01test1306, this is Sana from test. Let’s begin with the first question: Can you tell me about a time when you faced a difficult challenge and how you handled it?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-13T09:46:46.684Z","sessionId":"cmqc5xtlv0007mp01nx9s3y6x","orderIndex":0,"timestampMs":730},{"id":"cmqc688bg000cmp01wa5wmn0i","message":"Yes. So, this challenge was about the database development project, where I was responsible to collect all the information from the past projects data, the information was all spread in different file formats like Excel or PDF or hard copies or drawings. So, to collect them and structure them and clean the entire data to make it reusable for the platform was a tough task. So, I decided to make a team of 10 people who would be working on different data sets independently and then provide solution as per the requirement and it worked well. It was a tedious task, but we achieved.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-13T09:46:46.684Z","sessionId":"cmqc5xtlv0007mp01nx9s3y6x","orderIndex":1,"timestampMs":12184},{"id":"cmqc688bg000dmp01jqk11ydy","message":"Understood, that sounds like a complex data integration challenge. Now, let’s dive into the fundamentals: can you walk me through the laws of thermodynamics?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-13T09:46:46.684Z","sessionId":"cmqc5xtlv0007mp01nx9s3y6x","orderIndex":2,"timestampMs":83877},{"id":"cmqc688bg000emp0138sol9i0","message":"Yes, there are four laws of thermodynamics, the zeroth law which is about temperature equivalence, where which sees that when two objects are at different temperatures when brought together will come to a common temperature. This first law which is about conservation of energy, so energy cannot be created nor destroyed it can be it can change its form. Second law of thermodynamics is about entropy which says entropy of a system always tends to increase and the fourth law is about absolute entropy.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-13T09:46:46.684Z","sessionId":"cmqc5xtlv0007mp01nx9s3y6x","orderIndex":3,"timestampMs":96556},{"id":"cmqc688bg000fmp01fwauvywd","message":"Thanks for that overview. Let’s explore a bit more: can you explain how the second law applies in practical engineering scenarios?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-13T09:46:46.684Z","sessionId":"cmqc5xtlv0007mp01nx9s3y6x","orderIndex":4,"timestampMs":149439},{"id":"cmqc688bg000gmp01f7cnl7jv","message":"It is used in power plants for heat sink related activities, which says that when Heat is applied to any object. It''s energy loser and then for key increases","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-13T09:46:46.684Z","sessionId":"cmqc5xtlv0007mp01nx9s3y6x","orderIndex":5,"timestampMs":162534},{"id":"cmqc688bg000hmp01evui3208","message":"Got it, that’s a good example. Now, let’s move on to manufacturing: can you describe a common manufacturing process that you’ve worked with?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-13T09:46:46.684Z","sessionId":"cmqc5xtlv0007mp01nx9s3y6x","orderIndex":6,"timestampMs":192278},{"id":"cmqc688bg000imp01csmlp0fz","message":"Yes, casting was one of the manufacturing processes on which I worked so Yes","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-13T09:46:46.684Z","sessionId":"cmqc5xtlv0007mp01nx9s3y6x","orderIndex":7,"timestampMs":203702},{"id":"cmqc688bg000jmp01mzy46nvc","message":"Understood. Can you briefly outline the key steps involved in the casting process?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-13T09:46:46.684Z","sessionId":"cmqc5xtlv0007mp01nx9s3y6x","orderIndex":8,"timestampMs":225662},{"id":"cmqc688bg000kmp01tj1zazps","message":"In the casting process, the molten metal is first poured into the die, then it is allowed to cool. Once the product cools, it is taken out and some amount of finishing process is done before handing over.","speaker":"CANDIDATE","createdAt":"2026-06-13T09:46:46.684Z","sessionId":"cmqc5xtlv0007mp01nx9s3y6x","orderIndex":9,"timestampMs":233977},{"id":"cmqc688bg000lmp018oriurjc","message":"Thank you for summarizing that. Now, could you explain what additive manufacturing is and how it differs from casting?","speaker":"INTERVIEWER","createdAt":"2026-06-13T09:46:46.684Z","sessionId":"cmqc5xtlv0007mp01nx9s3y6x","orderIndex":10,"timestampMs":273210}],"domain":"Junior mechanical engineer","keySkills":["Thermodynamics","Manufacturing"],"scoringModel":"gpt-4.1-mini","positionTitle":"Junior mechanical engineer","mandatoryQuestions":["Laws of thermodyanmics","manufacturing process","additive manufacturing"]}', null, null, 0, null, null, '2026-06-13 09:46:48.627', '2026-06-13 09:46:48.627');